sequenceDiagram
participant M as Main
participant G as Guice
participant Mod as CoworkingModule
participant I as Injector
participant S as SqliteTimeIntervalStorage
participant B as Booking
participant H as StaticHtmlExporter
M->>G: createInjector(new CoworkingModule())
G->>Mod: configure(): bind Storage to SqliteStorage
G-->>M: Injector
M->>I: getInstance(Booking.class)
I->>Mod: connection() @Provides @Singleton
I->>S: new(connection)
I->>B: @Inject Booking(storage)
I-->>M: Booking
M->>B: add(interval)
B->>S: save(interval)
S-->>B: записано SQLite
B-->>M: Інтервал додано
M->>B: confirm(access), invoice через Accountant
M->>S: findAll()
S-->>M: інтервали з SQLite
M->>H: write(intervals, target/intervals.html)
